    "description": "## Objective\n\nCreate Deal_Rep_Assignment__c to record, as dated history, which Brand Ambassador owns which Deal over time. Assignment changes create new records; history is never overwritten.\n\n## Fields\n\n* Assignment ID — Name — Auto Number\n* Deal — Deal\\__c — Lookup(Deal_\\_c), Required\n* Deal External ID — Deal_External_ID\\__c — Formula(Text) — Dealr.External_Deal_ID_\\_c\n* Rep (BA) — Rep__c — Lookup(User), Required\n* Rep External Id — Rep_External_Id__c — Text(80) — backend-supplied id; set via API\n* Brand Manager (BM) — Sales_Manager__c — Lookup(User)\n* Link Slug — Link_Slug__c — Text(255) — reference/audit only\n* Assignment Status — Assignment_Status__c — Picklist, Required — Active; Paused; Ended; Review Required\n* Effective From — Effective_From__c — Date/Time, Required\n* Effective To — Effective_To__c — Date/Time — blank = currently active\n* Assignment Source — Assignment_Source__c — Picklist — Manual; Migration; API; Other\n* Notes — Notes__c — Long Text Area(4000)\n\n## Implementation Requirements\n\n* Create the custom object with the fields above; help text per design doc story C-02\n* Related list on Deal showing assignment history\n\n## Acceptance Criteria\n\n* Assignment records creatable\n* The same Deal can hold multiple assignment records for the same BA across different date ranges\n\n## Testing Notes\n\nCreate two sequential assignments on one Deal; confirm both persist.\n\n## Out of Scope\n\nNon-overlap validation (post-POC). Rep quotas/caps. Automated status updates.\n\n## Open Questions\n\n* Is Date/Time precision required on Effective From/To, or is a Date sufficient?\n* Can two assignments for the same Deal intentionally overlap, or should overlaps always be blocked?\n\n---\n\nEstimate: M · \\~6h · Dependencies: POC-06 · Ticket POC-07 (approved 2026-07-04)",
